''Unnamed Suit 046''' is a [[Suit]] from [[the Organization]]. He operated from the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]] in [[Paris, France]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit pretended to be a researcher from the [[Huntik Foundation]] working in the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]]. When [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Dante Vale]] entered the mausoleum and opened the wall, he and his team tried to attack but they were overpowered by Dante and Lok. He was later left to guard the entrance to Mausoleum. {{source|Memory Lane}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n\n== Abilities ==\n{{col-begin}}{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}{{col-end}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nUnnamed Suit 046.png\nS1E18 Mausoleum Suits.png|Suit 046 with the other uncover agents\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot","label":"Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot","target_id":"huntik:page:5924","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mausoleum_of_Sir_Lancelot","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5924"},{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry